Tavern SFU audio-permission prototype

This directory contains modifications to LiveKit and LiveKit Protocol under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. It is not an official upstream release.

The patches add Tavern's optional audio-subscription grant, preserve its
presence during permission updates and token refresh, revoke active audio,
validate declared and negotiated media kinds, and add isolated regression
tests. Exact upstream revisions and changed files appear in provenance.json.

Unmodified upstream licenses and notices are retained in licenses/. The SFU
notice includes the upstream ion-sfu attribution. Dependencies remain pinned
by the upstream Go module manifests and checksums. This build has not been
published; a complete binary dependency license/SBOM review remains part of
release preparation.
